                        "rating":  3,
                        "text":  {
                                     "text":  "Food is excellent, the atmosphere is well-designed to have ample natural light along with greenery everywhere.\n\nHowever, we pre-ordered the food more than an hour before arrival and there were two dishes already sitting at our table when we arrived and the other dishes came out at various times.\n\nSo while we were here, some of us were close to finishing our meal while others just started their meal. The appetizer of fries also came much later than our mains and drinks for some reason.\n\nOverall, still a nice experience, and would still recommend this place, but the service could be better.",
                                     "languageCode":  "en"
                                 },
                        "originalText":  {
